- Drone_1 will stay in "protecting Field_1" since it is already protecting it.
- The idle drones (Drones 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8) will be assigned to "protecting Field_1" until there are 4 drones in total, which means Drones 2, 3, and 4 will also be assigned to Field_1.
